  "notes": "GAAP basis SID, governmental funds only. Receipts/disbursements from Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Issuance of long-term debt 659,203 = debt_proceeds; Payment of warrants (1,582,861) = other_financing. Balance sheet = Government-Wide Statement of Net Position (p1). Ending cash and investments from governmental funds balance sheet (p3). Detail schedules (pp5-6) are budgetary (Non GAAP) basis; actuals differ from GAAP statement; recorded as printed. Warrant interest payments, '-' actual lines omitted. Read pages 1-6 of 6",
